  message: "Merged 4f6dade424 (bundle). production_callables now skips nodes with truthy protocol_origin (ADR-0031 Class-B synthetic linker stand-ins) before adding to dead-code candidates — they were ~100% flagged dead (language=None can't match language-scoped seeds). Keyed on protocol_origin (NOT framework_role, which marks Class-A route callables; NOT language-is-None). The item's 'language-stamping producer gap' premise was corrected by triage — the stand-ins are intentionally language=None, so the fix is consumer-side. RED/GREEN + positive control (Class-A route marker stays a candidate). Core 100%."  # 107f
